{"projectInfo":{"name":"EVPN和DRNI三层转发配置举例","path":"evpndrnilay3","visibility":2,"categoryId":112,"introduction":"Switch A、Switch B、Switch D为与服务器连接的VTEP设备，Switch A和Switch B分布式聚合为一台虚拟VTEP设备，通过IPL（Intra-Portal Link，内部控制链路）同步MAC地址和ARP信息。Switch C作为路由反射器在Switch A、Switch B、Switch D之间反射路由。虚拟机VM 1和VM 5属于VXLAN 10，VM4属于VXLAN 20，通过分布式EVPN网关实现不同VXLAN之间互通。","label":["EVPN","VXLAN","L2vpn","DRNI"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"SWA","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWC","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWB","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Server1","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Server1.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Server2","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Server2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWD","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWD.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM4","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM4.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM5","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM5.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM1","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM1.cfg"}]}